+ Access is Union

| private-access
| public-access
| family-access

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ TypeMatchOperator is Union

| match-convertible
| match-similar
| match-exactly

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ ClauseOperator is Union

| whenever-clause
| when-clause
| while-clause
| until-clause
| keyed-by-clause

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ is-pipeline-closure Bool
    - op Operator

` A map or filter pipeline compiles its right operand as a closure over the item; a forward
` pipe passes the left value to a call and a write pipe loops in place.
op == .map-op || op == .filter-op || op == .map-filter-op

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ is-pipeline-nested Bool
    - op Operator

` Every pipeline whose right operand is the body of a generated closure: the map and filter
` forms over `each`, a tap over `each` whose result is discarded, and a closure pipe over `it`.
is-pipeline-closure(op) || op == .pipe-repeat-op || op == .pipe-closure-op

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ is-constant-arithmetic Bool
    - op Operator

` The binary operators a constant expression of numbers can be evaluated through: arithmetic,
` powers, and the bitwise operators, which work on 32 bits.
arithmetic || op == .mod-op || op == .pow-op || bitwise || shift

.. arithmetic = op == .add-op || op == .subtract-op || op == .multiply-op || op == .divide-op
.. bitwise = op == .bitwise-and-op || op == .bitwise-or-op || op == .bitwise-xor-op
.. shift = op == .bitwise-lshift-op || op == .bitwise-rshift-op || op == .bitwise-zrshift-op

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ is-comparison Bool
    - op Operator

|? op == .less-than-op || op == .greater-than-op
    true
|? op == .less-than-equals-op || op == .greater-than-equals-op
    true
??
    op == .equals-op || op == .not-equals-op

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ is-type-test Bool
    - op Operator

|? op == .is-op || op == .is-not-op
    true
|? op == .is-exactly-op || op == .is-not-exactly-op
    true
??
    op == .is-similar-op || op == .is-not-similar-op

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ increment-base Operator?
    - op Operator

match? op
    |= .add-eq-op
        .add-op
    |= .subtract-eq-op
        .subtract-op
    |= .multiply-eq-op
        .multiply-op
    |= .divide-eq-op
        .divide-op
    |= .mod-eq-op
        .mod-op
    |= .pow-eq-op
        .pow-op
    |= .concat-eq-op
        .concat-op
